
                       geant4-11-02-ref-08
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Fixed setting of file compression level in G4GenericFileManager.
 o Implemented new model of ionization losses for e+- ionization for
   channeling using the new channeling dataset.
 o Implemented production and decay of omega(780) and f2(1270) for pion
   projectile and implemented decay of unstable isomeres if recoil nucleus
   if not a natural isotope.
 o New dataset: G4ENSDFSTATE-3.0, PhotonEvaporation-6.0 and
   RadioactiveDecay-6.0.1.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

cmake                                            cmake-V11-02-25
-----
- Support running example build-and-run tests in XCode on macOS.
- Set default for GEANT4_INSTALL_PACKAGE_CACHE to be OFF.
  This file is highly unstable on macOS and Spack installs, causing more
  problems for most users than it solves. Retain the ability to install
  this file if really wanted, but change the default to NOT install it; in
  general this will not change anything for users provided they have a
  reproducible build environment setup.
- New datasets: G4ENSDFSTATE-3.0, PhotonEvaporation-6.0 and
  RadioactiveDecay-6.0.1.

